lean4cobol contains a COBOL port of lean4lean, by Mario Carneiro and
contributors, licensed under Apache-2.0. Reference revision:
bce3448115f7819fc12d647fadd3bb090666637e (arena branch).
https://github.com/digama0/lean4lean

The port changes the implementation language and data representation.
The compiled quotation tables are generated from the same pinned lean4lean
source; tests/primitive-quotes.lean and scripts/generate-primitive-quotes.py
record their derivation.

The NDJSON fixtures under tests/fixtures/inductive are exports of Lean Kernel
Arena tutorial cases, licensed under Apache-2.0. Their source revision and
content hashes are recorded in that directory's manifest.json.
https://github.com/leanprover/lean-kernel-arena

The NDJSON fixtures under tests/fixtures/primitive, mutual, nested, arithmetic, and strings include
exports from Lean 4's
Init library, by Microsoft Corporation and contributors, licensed under
Apache-2.0. The toolchain, exporter revision, command, and content hash are
recorded in that directory's manifest.json.
https://github.com/leanprover/lean4

The fixed fuel-boundary fixture under tests/fixtures/fuel is generated from
lean4lean's TypeChecker methods at the reference revision above. Its Lean source
and hashes are recorded alongside the fixture.
